    <section class="py-12 sm:py-16 px-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center mb-10 space-y-2">
            <span class="bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 text-xs font-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">Frequently Asked Questions</span>
            <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900">Got Questions? We Have Answers</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
            <!-- FAQ 1 -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
                <button onclick="toggleFaq(1)" class="w-full p-4 sm:p-5 text-left font-bold text-slate-900 flex justify-between items-center focus:outline-none">
                    <span class="text-sm sm:text-base">Do you service areas outside Cape Town like Wellington, Paarl, and Winelands?</span>
                    <i id="faqIcon-1" class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-amber-500 transition-transform"></i>
                </button>
                <div id="faqContent-1" class="hidden px-5 pb-5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">
                    <strong>Yes!</strong> We frequently install driveway gates, pedestrian gates, and privacy fencing in Wellington, Paarl, Stellenbosch, Somerset West, Northern Suburbs (Kraaifontein, Brackenfell, Bellville, Durbanville), Southern Suburbs, and the West Coast. Contact us with your area for quick scheduling!
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ 2 -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
                <button onclick="toggleFaq(2)" class="w-full p-4 sm:p-5 text-left font-bold text-slate-900 flex justify-between items-center focus:outline-none">
                    <span class="text-sm sm:text-base">Why is hot-dip galvanized steel framing better than painted mild steel?</span>
                    <i id="faqIcon-2" class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-amber-500 transition-transform"></i>
                </button>
                <div id="faqContent-2" class="hidden px-5 pb-5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">
                    Cape Town’s coastal air contains high salt levels that quickly corrode painted mild steel from the inside out. <strong>Hot-dip galvanizing</strong> submerges the entire steel frame into molten zinc, forming an unbreakable rust barrier that protects the gate inside and out for decades.
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ 3 -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
                <button onclick="toggleFaq(3)" class="w-full p-4 sm:p-5 text-left font-bold text-slate-900 flex justify-between items-center focus:outline-none">
                    <span class="text-sm sm:text-base">Can you fit Nutec privacy slats to my existing steel fence or gate?</span>
                    <i id="faqIcon-3" class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-amber-500 transition-transform"></i>
                </button>
                <div id="faqContent-3" class="hidden px-5 pb-5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">
                    <strong>Yes, absolutely!</strong> Our Privacy Slat Upgrade service retrofits precision custom-cut timber-grain Nutec slats directly onto your existing gate or fence frame. This gives you total privacy and a fresh modern aesthetic at a fraction of the cost of a full new gate installation.
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ 4 -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
                <button onclick="toggleFaq(4)" class="w-full p-4 sm:p-5 text-left font-bold text-slate-900 flex justify-between items-center focus:outline-none">
                    <span class="text-sm sm:text-base">Can Nutec cladding be painted or stained in different colors?</span>
                    <i id="faqIcon-4" class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-amber-500 transition-transform"></i>
                </button>
                <div id="faqContent-4" class="hidden px-5 pb-5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">
                    <strong>Yes.</strong> Nutec fiber-cement boards bond exceptionally well with exterior acrylic paints and timber stains. We offer natural wood finishes, sleek charcoal grey, modern black, white, or custom paint matching to blend seamlessly with your garage door or building exterior.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

